    "End-to-end SQL, including PyMySQL/GIL/network/gateway/result decoding and exact row validation. Not storage capacity evidence.",
    "Only leader TX/process CPU is measured, not total RF3 replica CPU. RF3 is a fsync/quorum read control, not failover/write-throughput evidence.",
    "Lua GC allocation and native Rust requested-capacity allocation are separate categories. Neither includes Tarantool C/tuple memory or RSS; B128 Rust requested bytes can exceed the Lua-GC category.",
    "No idle CPU subtraction. Observer/background overhead is retained. Each mode uses the same featureON module.",
    "Five paired trials percase, strict trial parity LuaFirst/NativeFirst/LuaFirst/NativeFirst/LuaFirst. Individual ratios/min/max are retained; no confidence interval or uniform latency/rate win is claimed.",
    "Routine load_window handbacks remain included and reconcile exact per-query served+handback counters. No other fallback accepted.",
    "SQL IN semantics deduplicate duplicate inputs and ORDER BY id; batch denotes IN-list length, not distinct returned rows.",
    "All raw latency u64le samples and original phase JSON remain separate data artifacts with hashes."
